<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S4.F4.sf2.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(b)</span> </span><span id="S4.F4.sf2.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Layer-wise (OOD)</span></figcaption>
